                                    "text": "The main reason for all the evieve smoothers is to have these utilities inside the gen~ and GenExpr environments. However the evieve smoothers add interesting algorithms that we might choose creatively, not just because they are cheap. In this tab we compare the sound of some different smoothers and why we might choose them over native algorithms. Note, more information is available in the helpfiles, reference pages and .genexpr source code.",
